OL,4,BMotorcycle passenger who took stunning 
OL,5,Bcricket catch found                    
OL,6,G"I told my friend riding the           
OL,7,Gmotorcycle to duck his head. I'm going 
OL,8,Gto catch it."                          
OL,10,FMehran Khan amazed sports fans around  
OL,11,Fthe world this week when he caught a   
OL,12,Fcricket ball while sitting on the back 
OL,13,Fof a moving motorcycle.                
OL,15,FMehran was passing a match in the Swat 
OL,16,FPremier League in Mingora, Pakistan,   
OL,17,Fwhen a ball sailed out of the ground   
OL,18,Ftowards him, with the passenger        
OL,19,Freaching out to catch it one-handed.   
